      "id": 1538,
      "hub_id": 2108,
      "guid": "com.acidphantasm.reffriendlyquests",
      "name": "Ref - SPT Friendly Quests",
      "slug": "ref-spt-friendly-quests",
      "teaser": "Converted all the Arena specific quests for Ref into SPT quests. Rewards the same things as Live, with an added Lega Medal to each quest. Includes the sword unlock and secure container.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2108.png",
      "downloads": 276604,
      "favourites_count": 279,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Ref - SPT Friendly Quests</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>NOTE: Deletion may not be possible because this mod adds quests. You may need to start a new profile.\nIf you insist on removing it, you can do the following.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-reffriendlyquests</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">RECOMMENDED MODS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Recommended Mods:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1508-kaeno-traderscrolling/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kaeno-TraderScrolling</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2109-bosses-have-lega-medals/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bosses Have Lega Medals</a></p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
