          "hub_id": null,
          "version": "2.1.0",
          "description": "### **This version will only work for SPT 4.1.x**\n\nNew Features\n- Loyalty Level Multiplier (So you can set your own loyalty levels, default is 0.85 which makes LL4 0.96)\n- Added config to SIC\n\nChanges\n- Changed `ChangeLoyalty4RepRequirements` to `ChangeLoyaltyLevelRequirements` which enables the multiplier to work\n- Adjusted TGH quests to 10, 15, 20, 25, 50 PMC kills\n- Adjusted Against the Conscience Part 2 to 10 kills for each weapon class (down from 50)",
